cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Silicera"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Silicera Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/theworker02/silicera"
url: "https://silicera.dev"
abstract: >-
  Silicera is experimental Rust research software for hardware-native program
  specialization on AMD Zen processors. The physical machine is treated as an
  input to specialization via measured Hardware-Native Execution Profiles (HNEP).
  Not affiliated with Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
keywords:
  - AMD Zen
  - program specialization
  - autotuning
  - HNEP
  - runtime systems
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-12"
